            },
            "body": "I have carried the same change on my tree since early September as a local hotfix (append the transfer to `failed_ids` when `check_xfer_state()` raises, then the existing post-loop cleanup releases it), identical in effect to this diff minus the `exc_info`. It has run on six cells and around fifty P2P pulls on GLM-5.2-FP8 DP8 with NIXL 1.4.1 with no regression. The path itself did not fire in those runs, so this is not a live confirmation of the recovery, only that the change is safe and matches what we arrived at independently. Together with #55553 it covers both paths in #55181. LGTM.\n",
